superdiagonal, F = J₋ with entries 3, 4, 3, H = [E, F] = diag(3, 1, −1, −3)) is 𝔰𝔩(16, ℂ). Each Chevalley generator
E_{i,i+1}, E_{i+1,i} is an explicit rational combination of nested brackets of the generators; the brackets and
